{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dear Marie,\n\nI am writing to you from The Hague, where I arrived today after 8 o'clock. The journey through Holland was pleasant; the weather was wonderful, the landscape endlessly flat, dotted with ships and green meadows. It is a country that lives by trade and freedom, yet it lacks the depth of the historical spirit that we know in Germany. Here everything is external, visible, clear – like the North Sea, which I intend to visit tomorrow.\n\nThink of me when you think of the sea. Karl and Immanuel may be well; Ludwig too. I will perhaps bring you a small memento from here, if time permits. Until I am back in Berlin, I write rarely. Forgive me the silence.\n\nYour G. W. F. Hegel"}}],"created":1795221052,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":162,"prompt_tokens":244,"total_tokens":406,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-BbY5xWiDJrlRdfhGNDyHJFVOpvexi599","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":244,"prompt_ms":607.732,"prompt_per_token_ms":2.4907049180327867,"prompt_per_second":401.49276325748855,"predicted_n":162,"predicted_ms":3737.605,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.214937888198758,"predicted_per_second":43.075712923115205}}